---
import isotipo from "../assets/Financial isotipo.svg";
import feswLogo from "../assets/Logo Light Mode FESW.svg";
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden py-16">
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-6 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <img src={isotipo.src} alt="" width="32" height="32" class="h-8 w-8" />
        <span class="font-extrabold text-petrol">Financial</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
        Plataforma de formalización municipal con agentes de IA sobre WhatsApp.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-petrol">Un proyecto presentado en:</span>
        <a
          href="https://informatica.usm.cl/eventos/33-feria-de-software/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-xl border border-petrol/20 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
        >
          <img src={feswLogo.src} alt="Feria de Software" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" class="h-11 w-auto" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-petrol">Explora</h3>
      <nav class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-base text-petrol">
        <a href="#como-funciona" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">¿Cómo funciona?</a>
        <a href="#municipalidad" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Para la Municipalidad</a>
        <a href="#impacto-roi" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Impacto & ROI</a>
        <a href="#casos-de-uso" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Casos de Uso</a>
        <a href="#seguridad" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Seguridad</a>
        <a href="#video" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Video</a>
        <a href="#vision-mision" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Visión y Misión</a>
        <a href="#equipo" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald">Equipo</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-petrol">Contáctanos</h3>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-base text-petrol">
        <a href="mailto:grupofinancial06@gmail.com" class="transition-colors hover:text-emerald"
          >grupofinancial06@gmail.com</a
        >
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/56954419466"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="WhatsApp"
          class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-petrol/25 text-petrol transition-colors hover:border-emerald/40 hover:text-emerald"
        >
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="M12 3a9 9 0 0 0-7.75 13.5L3 21l4.5-1.2A9 9 0 1 0 12 3Z"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
            <path
              d="M8.5 8.3c0 4.1 3.1 7.2 7.2 7.2l.6-1.2a.8.8 0 0 1 .9-.4l1.6.5a.8.8 0 0 1 .6.8v1.2a1 1 0 0 1-1 1C13.1 17.4 6.6 10.9 6.6 6.2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1.2a.8.8 0 0 1 .8.6l.5 1.6a.8.8 0 0 1-.4.9l-1.2.6Z"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.3"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/financial.cl/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Instagram"
          class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-petrol/25 text-petrol transition-colors hover:border-emerald/40 hover:text-emerald"
        >
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
            <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/financialcl/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
          class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-petrol/25 text-petrol transition-colors hover:border-emerald/40 hover:text-emerald"
        >
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
            <path
              d="M7 10.5V17M7 7v.01M11 17v-4.5a2 2 0 0 1 4 0V17M11 17v-6.5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative mx-auto mt-14 flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-petrol/20 px-6 pt-8 text-sm text-petrol sm:flex-row lg:px-8"
  >
    <p>© 2026 Financial · Plataforma de Formalización Municipal.</p>
    <p>Hecho para transformar la economía informal de su comuna.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
